10
01:00:42,857 --> 01:00:48,857
Rising (also known as Ederlezi Rising and Ederlezi ébredése) is a 2018 English-language Serbian science fiction film directed by Lazar
Bodroža and based on a 1980s short story by Zoran Nešković that was adapted for film by screenwriter Dimitrije Vojnov.

11
01:06:47,142 --> 01:06:53,142
The film stars Sebastian Cavazza, Stoya, Marusa Majer, and Kirsty Besterman.

12
01:12:51,428 --> 01:12:57,428
The film explores themes of android, artificial intelligence
(a.i.), dystopia, soviet union, space mission.

13
01:18:55,714 --> 01:19:01,714
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
